---
import FeatureAnimation from "../react/animation/FeatureAnimation.jsx";
---


<section id="features" class="scroll-mt-16 mt-16 md:mt-32 mb-24 md:mb-48 py-12 md:py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-black via-gray-900 to-black">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 md:mb-16 feature-header">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-3 md:mb-4">Fitur Unggulan HydroVision</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm md:text-base px-2">
              Sistem prediksi curah hujan berbasis LSTM yang dirancang khusus untuk wilayah Gorontalo. Akurat, real-time, dan mudah diintegrasikan.
          </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-8">
          <div class="card-hover rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6 text-center shadow-xl backdrop-blur-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/30 hover:-translate-y-1 feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon mx-auto">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 md:h-8 md:w-8 text-blue-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 2a10 10 0 100 20 10 10 0 000-20zM12 6v6l4 2" /></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold mb-2 md:mb-3">Fokus Wilayah Gorontalo</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm md:text-base">Model LSTM dilatih khusus dengan data historis curah hujan Gorontalo selama 5 tahun, menghasilkan prediksi yang relevan dan kontekstual.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-hover rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6 text-center shadow-xl backdrop-blur-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/30 hover:-translate-y-1 feature-card">
              <div class="feature-icon mx-auto">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 md:h-8 md:w-8 text-blue-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16" /></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold mb-2 md:mb-3">Evaluasi Model Terbuka</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm md:text-base">Tersedia grafik evaluasi akurasi model: perbandingan data aktual vs prediksi, serta visualisasi error dan loss untuk validasi ilmiah.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="card-hover rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6 text-center shadow-xl backdrop-blur-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/30 hover:-translate-y-1 feature-card sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
              <div class="feature-icon mx-auto">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 md:h-8 md:w-8 text-blue-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold mb-2 md:mb-3">Prediksi Real-Time</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm md:text-base">Model LSTM mampu memproses data secara langsung dan memberikan prediksi curah hujan hingga 3 bulan ke depan.</p>
          </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<FeatureAnimation client:load />
